Sreyoshi Chakraborty, MPO Senior Planner, reviewed project funding options, the Pavement
Management list and what this encompasses and how streets are added to the list, cost of design and
construction recommended in Phase I of the Pershing Blvd. Complete Streets study, with a $110,000
estimate that would include everything for completion of the project.  Motion to amend carried.
Voting “yes” -- all members of the governing body present with the exception of Mr. Brown, Mr.
Roybal and Mayor Kaysen voting “no”.  Further discussion followed on concerns with using the City’s
reserves to fund the project.  Mr. Shanor moved to amend the “NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT
RESOLVED” paragraph as follows: “NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE
GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, that Phase I of the Pershing Blvd. Complete
